# Defaults for the ArduPilot SITL boat (DRY-COVERAGE-PLAN.md item 12.G.1). ArduPilot's own copter and rover
# default files carry these lines, with the comment below, and its motorboat file does not -- the same gap
# `plane.parm` closes for the fixed wing. Without them the firmware refuses to arm the boat with "3D Accel
# calibration needed", which is the firmware being right about an uncalibrated accelerometer and wrong about a
# simulated one. Nothing else is set.
#
# Unlike `plane.parm` this file is not copied into the image: `run-sim.sh` reads it from the tree the container
# mounts, beside the script that names it, so the boat's defaults change with the test that needs them and not
# with a rebuild of a 600 MB image.
#
# we need small INS_ACC offsets so INS is recognised as being calibrated
INS_ACCOFFS_X   0.001
INS_ACCOFFS_Y   0.001
INS_ACCOFFS_Z   0.001
INS_ACCSCAL_X   1.001
INS_ACCSCAL_Y   1.001
INS_ACCSCAL_Z   1.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_X  0.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_Y  0.001
INS_ACC2OFFS_Z  0.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_X  1.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_Y  1.001
INS_ACC2SCAL_Z  1.001
